WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.000
Team Infernos presents ORBIS VOX, the Earth Jukebox for NASA Space Apps.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Earth science is mostly visual, shutting out blind and low-vision explorers.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
ORBIS VOX transforms authentic NASA satellite frames into quantized musical soundscapes:

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.500
City night lights, lightning storms, ocean currents, and atmospheric CO2.

5
00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:25.500
With full accessibility and offline WAV export, anyone can hear our living planet.

6
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:28.500
ORBIS VOX: Hear the living planet at midhunvvsggsg.github.io/orbis-vox/
